[{"title":"洞宾小像","author":"李昱","text":"洞庭湖水碧如天，一剑凌秋兴渺然。\n琪树金莲栽未了，人间回首又千年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36418,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨菊","author":"李昱","text":"山僧能剪砚池冰，墨色模糊巧作棱。\n自是东篱栽不得，却将秋影上溪藤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36419,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钩勒竹为王彦明题","author":"李昱","text":"金剪刀裁银凤尾，珊瑚钩挂玉龙魂。\n夜深秋影和霜重，压碎湘江月一痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36420,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画芦雁飞鸣宿食","author":"李昱","text":"一行斜起雪成群，嘹呖声多远更闻。\n夜冷芦汀眠不得，啄残千顷洞庭云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36421,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"李昱","text":"满林红雪影毵毵，夜静和春浸碧潭。\n却忆骑驴二三月，杏花小雨看江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36422,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"百雁图","author":"李昱","text":"十月开帆杨子江，沙寒白雁满船窗。\n画师貌得当年忆，宿食飞鸣五十双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36423,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画鱼 其一","author":"李昱","text":"东风吹动绿蘋洲，中有神鱼得自由。\n一跃玻璃三万顷，不贪香饵上金钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36424,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画鱼 其二","author":"李昱","text":"自从濠上无庄惠，此乐寥寥直到今。\n翠鬣锦鬐看似画，一篙春水落花深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36425,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题唐以仁山水图","author":"李昱","text":"莫怪柴门门未关，屋头无数好青山。\n暮年袖却丝纶手，一个鱼舟尽日閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36426,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牵黄熊回山","author":"李昱","text":"野性由来不入群，历阶穿窦恣纷纷。\n主人自有茅庐在，好去山中吠白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36427,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瓶中牡丹","author":"李昱","text":"古铜瓶中红牡丹，宛如仙女醉乘鸾。\n娇姿不贮黄金屋，却向茅檐造次看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36428,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝歌五首 其一","author":"李昱","text":"总宜船中载酒波，雁儿舞罢近前歌。\n日斜莫拗青荷叶，心似藕丝头绪多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36429,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝歌五首 其二","author":"李昱","text":"菱角钩衣为出尖，莲心苦口却回甜。\n妾生不恨郎缘薄，自恨春波日夜添。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36430,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝歌五首 其三","author":"李昱","text":"芙蓉花面藕丝裳，柳叶眉尖恨最长。\n嗔道王孙金弹子，朝朝来打野鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36431,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝歌五首 其四","author":"李昱","text":"湖上春来郎未归，青青杨柳想郎衣。\n郎今走马章台路，切莫颠狂作絮飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36432,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝歌五首 其五","author":"李昱","text":"家住西湖湖岸头，十三吹得乐官愁。\n连环欲结同心事，只怕郎心似水流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36433,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴二首 其一","author":"李昱","text":"鹧鸪春雨过东风，晴日桃花岸岸红。\n行到小桥闻犬吠，人家都在柳阴中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36434,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴二首 其二","author":"李昱","text":"桑叶绕绿多纤纤，蕨芽正肥春笋甜。\n茅屋人家风日好，老翁扪虱傍颓檐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":36435,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草阁图","author":"李昱","text":"双松树下半茅堂，万竹丛西一野航。\n画个老翁头似雪，坐间书卷对沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv"